Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:10.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜘蛛）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望我们继续他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真名叫贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot's her real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty frigging far from a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为特定客户获取一些独特的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I procure unique items for a select clientele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是神偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会发现那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇见过一个叫戈登·沃克的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever run across a guy named Gordon Walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于萨姆能看到幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about Sam's visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登接下来几年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon should be reaching for the soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定要捡肥皂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the next few years at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全都说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特不是单纯的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester is more than a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不确定他是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure he's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法帮我越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get me the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷靠近别人可不礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rude to sneak up on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉·塔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela Talbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我处于劣势了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登·沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你在监狱里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you were in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现良好提前释放吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Released early on good behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你才去过马萨诸塞州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were just in Massachusetts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道温家兄弟当时也跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you were with the Winchester boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再好好想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you think a little harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.39,0:01:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么急着找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so pressing about finding the boys, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特是反基督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester is the Antichrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我有所耳闻 - 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd heard something about that. - It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的好朋友 复活节兔子告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my good friend, the Easter bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是听牙仙说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd heard it from the tooth fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是没吃药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you off your meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关世界安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world hangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管自作聪明吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you go ahead and be a smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登 你和我不怎么熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon, you and I don't know each other very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以让我跟你讲讲我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me tell you a little something about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不理睬威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't respond well to threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你给我开个价\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you make me an offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会很乐意配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think you'll find me highly cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你告诉我他们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about, you tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我这就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I kill you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你能找到萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck finding Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以凑到三千\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can wrangle up three grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会为了三千起床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get out of bed for three grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了那个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把魔力袋给我 我们就算两清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the mojo bag and we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意有一个世纪的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's a century old,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是… - 无价之宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it's… - Priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多想找到温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how badly do you want the Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:03:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你求助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna call you some help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:03:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻起来很不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell good, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝起来更棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有点悬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutting it a little close, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是下饵罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just chumming the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么… - 你的血巢在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wha…? - Where's your nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你的血巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Your nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的吸血伙伴住在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you and your bloodsucking pals hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我感觉不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们再给你注射死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna feel hell of a lot worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感觉只会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we give you another shot of Dead Man's Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know we can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我服了某种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好抓狂 我不知道这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freaking out, I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你服了某种东西 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You took something? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,药效怎么都不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让它过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 露西 这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Lucy, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我们发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tell us what happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得不太清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's not that clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当时在蜘蛛 - 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was at Spider. - Spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰斐逊街的一家夜店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The club, on Jefferson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个男人 他请我喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was this guy, he was buying me drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.61,0:07:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺旧的 30岁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was old, like, 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他棕色头发 穿皮夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had brown hair, a leather jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫迪康还是迪克森的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deacon or Dixon or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他是毒贩 可以给我点药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was a dealer, he had something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 药 - 新药\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something? - Something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,前所未有的好药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than anything you ever tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往我的酒里滴了几滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put a few drops in my drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那药是红色粘稠质地的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the drug red and thick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是天才之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, genius move there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他给你下的是吸血鬼血 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was vampire blood he dosed you with. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你喝下了这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You just took a big steaming shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最可怕的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the nastiest virus out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吧 他是给我下了迷奸药之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy, he gave me roofies or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 我们就去了他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next thing I know, we're at his place…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他会去给我找东西吃 让我等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he says he's gonna get me something to eat, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我好饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I get so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就冲了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you busted out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但药效怎么都不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it won't wear off…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我的那不知什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever he gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,光线太亮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights too bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光伤你的皮肤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunshine hurts your skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能听到血液涌动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can hear blood pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想说这个 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to tell you this, sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的血再不会涌动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your blood's never pumping again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在半个街区外听到心跳声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear a heart beating from half a block away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.43,0:09:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让它停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want it to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 嬉皮姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, Wavy Gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉不会停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not going to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经杀了两个人 差点杀了第三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already killed two people, almost three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在追踪一堆处理大意的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We've been following a sloppy trail of corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直接带我们找到了你 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it leads straight to you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那药的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们得帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,问几个关于袭击的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few questions about the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经跟警察谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already talked to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以形容下袭击者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you describe your attacker?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有服了迷幻剂后的超大力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had that, uh, super PCP strength, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她咬了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gnawed on my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把血滴在你身上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did she bleed on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我身上 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴在你嘴里 或切开的伤口里 有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your mouth, open wound, anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我确定 你为什么问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女人携带了非常危险的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman has a very dangerous virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她咬了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-She bit me in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬伤不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bite doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要摄入她的血才会被感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to actually ingest the blood to be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们只能杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have had to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 袭击呢 - 她扑倒了我 然后咬了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The attack? - She jumped me, then bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那俩男人发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then those two guys found me, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,追着她进了小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}chased her down the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them was real tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a big fat waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.83,0:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,已有三个金发女孩失踪 包括露西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three blonds have gone missing, including Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后被看到都是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All last sighted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 迪恩 这是他的狩猎区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Dean, this is the hunting ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.60,0:12:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝一口这个 你就会彻底改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}One taste of this, you'll never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.27,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑 我去引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}run, I'll draw them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我半路去吃披萨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry. I stopped for a slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚真行啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice move you pulled back there, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正冲着武器就去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}running right at the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是屌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.47,0:14:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来戈登出狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess Gordon's out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么知道我们在哪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, how the hell did he know where to find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝拉 - 你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bela. - Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨天给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是为了感谢我救你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't to thank me for saving your ass, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登·沃克给我报酬让我说出你们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon Walker paid me to tell him where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿枪指着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he had a gun on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们有个凶巴巴的疯子要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell us that a raging psychopath was dropping by?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算打电话的 就是有事忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did fully intend to call. I just got a bit sidetracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他企图杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道这事这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't realize it was such a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 你们是两个人 他是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, there are two of you and one of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也是两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉 如果我们能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela, if we make it out of this alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一件要做的事就是杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first thing I'm gonna do is kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听我的声音 你说我是不是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to my voice, and tell me if I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're uncomfortable…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is just temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥饿感会过去 然后你就会觉得好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunger will pass and then you'll feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总铐着你的家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always keep your family in shackles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在熟悉彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still getting to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们才刚重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've just been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 你从街上抓走了几个可怜的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, you grabbed some poor girls off the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她们变成了你这样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made them monsters like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do what I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要绝种了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a dying breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你很清楚 是吧 戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know that, don't you, Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登·沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.19,0:16:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当世最伟大的吸血鬼猎人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the greatest living vampire hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我族人几乎绝种的重要原因之一 戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a big part of why my people are nearly extinct, Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你族人要绝种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people are going extinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你们是一群无脑嗜血的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're a bunch of mindless, bloodthirsty animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们比你嗜血多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we're so much more bloodthirsty than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人屠杀了我的整个血巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters slaughtered my entire nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是在开派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}like they were having a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdered my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都无法形容这种满足感多强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you how satisfying this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到杀死那么多人的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catching a hunter responsible for so many deaths…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你做我新女儿的午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and making you lunch for my new daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.03,0:17:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖牙婊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try fang-whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我伤到你的感情了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hurt your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了 你只是个被误解的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot, you're just a misunderstood victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在原始本能的趋势下传播你的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spread your filthy disease on pure base instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不如下水道的老鼠有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got less humanity than a sewer rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾你对我的族人看法这么差\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you have such a low opinion of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 计划有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会出去另给你们找午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be going out to get you lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有更好的办法处置你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a better idea for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.21,0:18:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那吸血鬼还在外面呢 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That vampire's still out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先做重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我们找到他 或他找到我们 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When we find him or if he finds us… - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是说 他没给我们多少选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just saying. He's not leaving us whole lot of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 这么爽快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you would've been, like:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那不行 他是人 这是不对的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No, we can't, he's a human, it's wrong."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登不会罢休的 除非他杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Gordon's not gonna stop until we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,或我们杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or until he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干吗 - 我不喜欢被人记仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I don't like it when people hold grudges against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是 我不希望被你杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more to the point, I'd rather you didn't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我替你找到了戈登的准确地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went ahead and found Gordon's exact location for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在百英里外呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hundred miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么… - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How the hell…? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大魔物供应商啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purveyor of powerful occult objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了通灵板联系了另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used a talking board to contact the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,两层 河滨 外面有霓虹灯牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two stories, riverfront, neon sign outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂有话告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit had a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「离开 拼命跑 无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Leave town, run like hell, and whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去找戈登「\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't go after Gordon."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever that's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.51,0:20:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登·沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不该把猎人带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have brought a hunter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.45,0:23:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.87,0:23:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted some kind of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好蠢啊 让他见到我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stupid, exposing him to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.79,0:23:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你真是个顾家男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're such a family man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.51,0:23:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.51,0:23:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想懂你个混…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna understand, you son…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有过那种感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever felt desperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我爱的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost everyone I ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.98,0:23:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要孤独地面对永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staring down eternity, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想到更可怕的地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of a worse hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有地狱嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.70,0:23:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.95,0:23:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.21,0:23:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you just don't give a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像心死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like being dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.67,0:24:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.23,0:24:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,头不是砍掉的 是扯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head wasn't cut off, it was ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人赤手扯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By someone's bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dixon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.36,0:24:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对戈登做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to Gordon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.65,0:24:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转化了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.04,0:25:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 尖牙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They? Those fangs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.97,0:25:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.19,0:25:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你必须杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.36,0:25:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让我先做完最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to let me do one last thing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.45,0:25:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 杀了萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Kill Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈登 - 这是唯一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gordon… - It's the only…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是这桩噩梦唯一的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the one good thing to come out of this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.87,0:25:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变强壮 敏捷了 我能干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stronger, I'm faster. I can finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.63,0:26:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.80,0:26:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't let you walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.51,0:26:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 这世上没有比这更重要的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. There is nothing more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.35,0:26:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.49,0:26:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以为这世界做最后一件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do one last good thing for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.58,0:26:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Gordon…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.84,0:26:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.21,0:26:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.86,0:27:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.63,0:27:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我都查了三十几家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I must have checked three dozen motels,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.05,0:27:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,空楼 仓库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}empty buildings, warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.92,0:27:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 城市很大 - 简直像茫茫大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big city. - It's like a giant haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.14,0:27:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登就是根致命的针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon's a deadly needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.77,0:27:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.10,0:27:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了太阳的拖累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the sun slowing him down…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.64,0:27:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 他会不可阻挡 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he'll be unstoppable. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.03,0:27:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果戈登知道我们的手机号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if Gordon knows our cell numbers…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能利用手机信号追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can use the cell signal to track us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.53,0:27:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.58,0:28:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗 你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.63,0:28:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.43,0:28:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not alone, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我不需要你给我签准假条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I don't need you to sign me a permission slip, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.93,0:28:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在追杀你 不是我 他还变身超人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's after you, not me, and he's turbocharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.23,0:28:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你远离危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to stay out of harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.10,0:28:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.81,0:28:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你别想自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, you're not going by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.15,0:28:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也只是普通的工作日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another day at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.11,0:28:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常危险的工作日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a massively dangerous day at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.82,0:28:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你现在是个不怕死的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you're the guy with nothing to lose now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.95,0:28:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我猜猜 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, let me guess. Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你反正也已经死了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because you're already dead. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 既然事实如此 - 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If the shoe fits. - You know what, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.66,0:28:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了你的敢死队作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick and tired of your old stupid kamikaze trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢死队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamikaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.37,0:28:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更像个忍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more like a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.54,0:28:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.50,0:28:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点好笑 - 才不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a little funny. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我做什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.92,0:28:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天闲坐着 写关于我要死了的悲情诗歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit around all day, writing sad poems about how I'm gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.26,0:28:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我想到了一首\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.26,0:28:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么跟「闭嘴 萨姆」押韵 - 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, what rhymes with "Shut up, Sam"? - Dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.31,0:29:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么犯浑了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop the attitude, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.97,0:29:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别总把一切当做笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit turning everything into a punch line.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.85,0:29:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再假装你不害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to act like you're not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.98,0:29:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不害怕 - 你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.90,0:29:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别装了 因为我能看穿你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may as well drop it because I can see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本在说胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.78,0:29:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.61,0:29:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在害怕 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕 因为你的一年要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared because your year's running out…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.78,0:29:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有摆脱下地狱的命运 你很慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're still going to hell and you're freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.25,0:29:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 因为我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how do you know that? - Because I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我这辈子一直跟着你转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, I've been following you around my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从四岁起就一直敬仰你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've been looking up to you since I was 4, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.09,0:29:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有样学样 想长大跟我大哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Studying you, trying to be just like my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 是的 我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yeah, I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.18,0:29:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这世上任何人都了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than anyone else in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.39,0:29:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是你非常害怕时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is exactly how you act when you're terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I mean, I can't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.44,0:29:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.57,0:29:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能别再装了 做回我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I wish you would drop the show and be my brother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.04,0:30:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.25,0:30:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们躲在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll hole up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.30,0:30:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩盖气息 让他无法追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover our scent so he can't track us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.18,0:30:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里挨过这一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait the night out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.97,0:30:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手机你才买了两小时 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had that phone two hours, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.55,0:30:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把号码给谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you give the number to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.97,0:31:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没给任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.81,0:31:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.48,0:31:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拿到这号码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.52,0:31:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机店里都是你的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scent's all over the cell phone store.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.11,0:31:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我现在闻不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I can't smell you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.57,0:31:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.24,0:31:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能找到我们了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you'll just have to find us, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.20,0:31:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更希望你自己来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather you come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.61,0:31:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Gord-o?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.20,0:31:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是怕我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not afraid of us, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.78,0:31:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就坐在这里 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just sitting here. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.12,0:31:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.42,0:31:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,收费公路边的河滨工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Factory on Riverside off the turnpike.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,20分钟内到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be here in 20 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.84,0:31:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则姑娘就死 - 戈登 放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- or the girl dies. - Gordon, let the girl go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.97,0:31:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 迪恩 - 戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Dean. - Gordon,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.10,0:31:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.18,0:31:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀无辜者 你还是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't kill innocent people, you're still a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.98,0:31:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.15,0:31:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.34,0:32:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.13,0:32:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.72,0:32:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.31,0:32:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们呢 来 扶她起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you. Come on. Get her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.22,0:32:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head. Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.90,0:32:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.11,0:32:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.02,0:33:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如愿困住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me where you want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.19,0:33:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不出来跟我打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well come out and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.78,0:33:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.11,0:33:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is really the way you wanna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.07,0:33:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我经历了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I faced…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.59,0:33:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,才走到这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.01,0:33:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.18,0:33:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.10,0:33:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.81,0:33:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我终于要杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm finally gonna kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.27,0:33:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎杀过的最危险的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most dangerous thing I ever hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.11,0:34:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是人 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not human, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也好意思说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.18,0:34:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.03,0:34:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个嗜血杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bloodthirsty killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.58,0:34:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说得好像你没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about it like you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.25,0:34:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.29,0:34:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do, Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.00,0:34:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没杀那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.67,0:34:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.04,0:34:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了糟糕得多的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something much, much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.53,0:34:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真得承认 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta hand it to you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你蒙蔽了好多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of people fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.91,0:34:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我清楚真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But see, I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.46,0:34:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.71,0:35:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在一样了 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same now, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.01,0:35:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道与邪恶共存的感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it is walking around with something evil inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.51,0:35:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 你不愿做该做的事 自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just too bad you won't do the right thing and kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.97,0:35:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.89,0:35:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我杀了你之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.94,0:35:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后两件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two last good-deeds:
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.77,0:35:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀你 自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing you and killing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.55,0:35:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.17,0:37:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚不带武器冲向了吸血鬼化的戈登\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just charged a super-vamped-out Gordon with no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点鲁莽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little reckless, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.24,0:37:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.91,0:37:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 查出嘎嘎声是什么发出的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Figure out what's making that rattle?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.70,0:37:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.16,0:37:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个管扳手 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a box wrench, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.17,0:37:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.62,0:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.88,0:37:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.55,0:37:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong one?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.39,0:37:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Come here for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.22,0:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.02,0:38:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那嘎嘎声有几种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This rattle could be a couple of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.86,0:38:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是汽化器问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking it's an out of tune carb.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.28,0:38:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.85,0:38:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你看这个 这是阀盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, see this thing? It's a valve cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.49,0:38:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是各种气缸盖零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside are all the parts that are on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.99,0:38:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我那把套筒扳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that socket wrench.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.58,0:38:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你跟得上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you with me so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.96,0:38:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.17,0:38:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,阀盖盖住气缸盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}valve cover covers the heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.83,0:38:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这是进气歧管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good. Now, this is your intake manifold, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.50,0:38:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On top of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.47,0:38:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽化器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A carburetor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汽化器 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carburetor. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.43,0:38:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.22,0:38:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗突然教我修车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the auto shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.73,0:38:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你难道是要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You don't mean you want…?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.77,0:38:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来修\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.11,0:38:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你都不怎么让我开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you barely let me drive this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.98,0:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.73,0:38:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该会修\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know how to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.86,0:38:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要学会这些东西 将来用得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need to know these things for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 这是我的职责嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, it's my job, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.62,0:39:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我弟弟做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showing my little brother the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.36,0:39:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用点力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your shoulder into it.
